@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000

### Kiem tra dich vu
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### Lay danh sach bai tap
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/assignments

### Tao luot nop hop le
# @name createSubmission
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assignmentId": 1,
  "studentCode": "DTC245200620",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://github.com/DTC245200620/CNTTK23D"
}

### Ma sinh vien rong phai tra 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assignmentId": 1,
  "studentCode": "",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://github.com/DTC245200620/CNTTK23D"
}

### Ma bai tap khong hop le phai tra 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assignmentId": 0,
  "studentCode": "DTC245200620",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://github.com/DTC245200620/CNTTK23D"
}

### Doc lai luot nop vua tao
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/submissions/{{createSubmission.response.body.$.id}}

### ID khong ton tai phai tra 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/submissions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
